{"id":"n85863-1-15","stage":1,"title":"감자 · 马铃薯","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85863-1-15-1","ko":"너는 감자랑 고구마랑 어떤 게 더 좋아?","zh":"你更喜欢土豆还是红薯呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감자랑","meaning":"马铃薯，土豆","explanation":"감자：马铃薯，土豆；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"감자","audio":"/audio/33f260e0ceece725d98e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85863","senseId":"1","lemma":"감자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고구마랑","meaning":"红薯，甘薯","explanation":"고구마：红薯，甘薯；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"고구마","audio":"/audio/bfc24bbfb62ba2e6a5bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28058","senseId":"1","lemma":"고구마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아?","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","